Package: ppmWass
Type: Package
Title: ppm-Aware Wasserstein Similarity for GC-HRMS Spectra
Version: 0.0.3.9001
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "Akifumi", family = "Eguchi", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "siero5335@gmail.com")
  )
Author: Akifumi Eguchi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Akifumi Eguchi <siero5335@gmail.com>
Description: Tools to compute ppm-aware Wasserstein and related similarity
    measures among EI-HRMS (GC-HRMS) fragmentation spectra, including fragment-
    and pooled derived mass-difference distances, optional typical-difference
    projections, and cluster explanation reports. Legacy neutral-loss argument
    names are retained for compatibility.
